{"id":"sbezhat_","lemma":"сбежать","pos":"verb","rank":895,"glosses":["to run down (from)","to run away, to make off, to flee, to break out","to escape"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bd/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B6%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B6%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"сбегу","2s":"сбежишь","3s":"сбежит","1p":"сбежим","2p":"сбежите","3p":"сбегут"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"сбеги","2p":"сбегите"}}},"past":{"m":"сбежал","p":"сбежали","f":"сбежала","n":"сбежало"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"сбегать","examples":[{"text":"Почему он сбежал?","en":"Why did he run away?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"he / it"},null]},{"text":"Почему ты пытался сбежать?","en":"Why did you try to run away?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to attempt, to try","l":"пытаться"},null]},{"text":"Наша собака сбежала.","en":"Our dog has run away.","words":[{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},{"g":"dog"},null]},{"text":"Почему вы пытались сбежать?","en":"Why did you try to run away?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to attempt, to try","l":"пытаться"},null]},{"text":"Давайте сбежим вместе.","en":"Let's escape together.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/926464","words":[{"g":"to let"},null,{"g":"together"}]}]}